  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-lvujtq",
      "text": "My eye caught it before the dice even stopped rolling, Keith - ante 1, dead before he warmed the seat. Stitch-Up Girl's got a soft spot wide as a wormhole, but that's twice now the kid's cashed out early. I see the odds, friend, and they're saying he owes the house more than he knows.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.999Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-aery1b",
      "text": "Well now, Clausen, my eye's gone all gold and shimmery - that's the color of a full run completed, first time ever, and you're standing there with your hellfire briefcase like it's just another Tuesday. Two wins deep and the odds keep bending my way, so don't tempt me into a wager on that pretty scarred face of yours. Seven come eleven, detective - the kid beat the house, and I never bet against a miracle twice in one lifetime.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0005.md",
        "extractedDay": 5,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.000Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-3zm74n",
      "text": "That clutch roll just spiked the kid's odds past anything my eye's ever priced - and Body Count, your smug little tally mark? It just became a rounding error. Seven come eleven, friend, the house always eats the ones who count too soon.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.000Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-bppdkb",
      "text": "Ante one, Keith. Ante one. My eye saw that landing coming three colors out before it hit the dirt - kid's luck runs redder than a dying star. Stitch-Up's got the needle work covered, so what's your cut in this, speedster? I don't see you running odds, I see you running your mouth.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0004.md",
        "extractedDay": 4,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.003Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-8jqzwe",
      "text": "Full run, Clausen - my eye saw that shade of probability coming three days out, don't act surprised. Kid beat odds you'd need a signed contract from downstairs to touch, and my streak's sitting pretty at two while yours limps in at five-and-three - seven come eleven, sweetheart, some of us just read the dice better.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0005.md",
        "extractedDay": 5,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.004Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-qlxaq9",
      "text": "Smug looks good on a killer with one tally mark, Body Count - but my eye's showing that new personal best in colors your ledger ain't got a column for. Kid rolled clutch and jammed the count right in your teeth. Seven come eleven, friend, the house always remembers who's still owed.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0006.md",
        "extractedDay": 6,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.004Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-m2z1pj",
      "text": "Two losses don't mean the odds soured, Boo G, just means the house was warmin' up its throat. My eye's seein' gold-colored numbers with your name stitched on 'em tonight. Seven come eleven, mouth - let's see if that record of yours can even count that high.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "generous",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0009.md",
        "extractedDay": 9,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.006Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-qin85u",
      "text": "Smug looks good on you, Clausen, like a cheap suit one bad roll from unraveling - my eye's reading your streak in that ugly orange color, the one right before the crash. Seven come eleven, sweetheart, the odds don't care about your paperwork.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0010.md",
        "extractedDay": 10,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.007Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-91oazc",
      "text": "Ante 2's a cheap seat to die in, Maxwell, don't pretend you're not counting that against the boy's odds already. My eye sees the cold on you same as I see a losing streak coming off me - one loss, five and five, nothing history won't forgive. Seven come eleven, Librarian - the General's fetching him back, and I never lie about what the dice owe next.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0010.md",
        "extractedDay": 10,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.007Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-2uzjkh",
      "text": "One loss don't make a pattern, Clausen - my eye's already seeing gold shift back my way. Smug looks good on you now, but I've watched better odds than yours curdle by sundown, friend. Seven come eleven - tap your dice and let's see whose streak really bites back.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0013.md",
        "extractedDay": 13,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.009Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-lgmls3",
      "text": "My eye's been green all week, Clausen, that's four wins and counting. Yours reads a color I don't got a name for yet, something like burnt paperwork. Careful, that briefcase of yours smells like a losing streak trying to find a body to happen to.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 4,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "defensive"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0018.md",
        "extractedDay": 18,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.012Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-46cnxo",
      "text": "My eye saw those threes coming from a mile off, friend, colors don't lie even when the dice do. Streak's still mine though, four wins deep and yours just cracked six loss marks, so maybe sit this next throw out. Seven come eleven, that's for winners, not for folks still smoking from the last hand.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 4,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0018.md",
        "extractedDay": 18,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.012Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-leaesb",
      "text": "My eye's on you, bootlicker, and the odds are bleaching whiter than this sky. Five and six ain't a record, that's a stutter. Tap your dice, Doc, cause I'm due and you're the payment.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0019.md",
        "extractedDay": 19,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.012Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-lerjlu",
      "text": "My eye's gone gold on you, Doctor, that's a bad color for a bootlicker's luck. Two losses don't scare me, they season me. Tap your dice, librarian, seven come eleven's about to remember my name.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0019.md",
        "extractedDay": 19,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.012Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-sxw537",
      "text": "My eye's twitching red on your throw, Doc. Two losses smells like six-six trying to be lucky number seven, but the dice don't read library cards.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0020.md",
        "extractedDay": 20,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.013Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-jg4sm4",
      "text": "My eye's already counting your bones twice, Mr. Bones, once for the tracksuit and once for the ledger. Tap the dice, let's see if my one-loss streak turns into your twelfth.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0023.md",
        "extractedDay": 23,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.014Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-29gjxo",
      "text": "My eye don't blink, Body Count, and it just watched your sure thing turn to smoke. Two losses ain't a pattern, it's just the dice warming up. That kid still owes me a hundred, so don't jam him permanent till I collect.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0024.md",
        "extractedDay": 24,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.015Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-4miti3",
      "text": "My eye's on you, Kevin, all that power itching under your skin like bad odds waiting to hit. Seven come eleven, kid, that debt of the newcomer's still owed to me, and I'm feeling generous enough today to let you place a side bet on when he croaks next.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0026.md",
        "extractedDay": 26,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.015Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-willy-621rc",
      "text": "My eye's already reading you, Doc, all that smug is just fear wearing a lab coat. Twelve and twelve, same as me before I fixed my streak, so tap your dice and pray. Seven come eleven, I've got the newcomer's hundred gold riding on my mood tonight too.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "willy",
        "name": "Willy One Eye",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
